content:
New technology needs new chips;
More chips you get more advanced you become;
Countries like USA and Chines use their powers to get more chips. 
Why can't we yet talk short? …

The Washington establishment knows what doesn't work, and keep doubling down on them (because they know it won't work and they can milk it forever): I.e.
- sanctioning other countries to submission... never worked... still doing it;
- spread US-style democracy on unwanted countries... never worked... still trying on Cuba and Venezuela;
- treated Russia and China as ennemies instead of partners... didn't work out so well, US still buying oil/uranium from Russia and buy everything else from China... still put out bill to sanction China and Russia on regular basis;
- deindustrialize and try to stay on top of the world... never worked for any empire... yet the US still hasn't made up its mind to reshore their industries in serious way... it still goes by handing out money to the billionaires and hoping that they'd do some real work; that won't work!
